{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\f1 Filter} (String, optional) - Filters configuration elements by Element Name using wildcard matching. The filter is automatically wrapped with wildcards (*) on both sides.\sa180\par}
